{
 "encounter_id": "00644",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good afternoon, doctor. Thank you for seeing me again so promptly. I'm afraid the boil has not gone away entirely."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good afternoon, Mr Whitfield. Nurse Sam is here to help. Tell me how things are since last time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The boil under my right arm has gone down a bit, but it's still there, about ten days now. And it remains rather painful."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How painful? Is it worse at particular times?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Moderate, I should say. It catches when I lift my arm, putting on a jacket, for instance."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever or shivers?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any similar lumps elsewhere, under the other arm or in the groin?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None in either place. This is the only one at present, though I've had others over the years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through the treatment. What are you using?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The tablets you gave me, doxycycline, 100 mg twice a day, which I've nearly finished. And the antiseptic wash, chlorhexidine, every day in the shower."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. What else is on your record, medically?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, acne when I was younger which I believe has persisted a little, and high cholesterol."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And you said you've had others over the years. Have you had any of them drained?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One, last year. The abscess drained under local anaesthetic, in the other armpit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm afraid so. About ten a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Shall I do your observations, Mr Whitfield? Arm out, please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Blood pressure 134 over 84, pulse 80, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, weight 92 kilos.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Sam. Right arm up, please, and let me have a look.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's a little tender. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's a tender swelling about three centimetres across under the right arm, with no spreading redness around it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that satisfactory? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's improving, which is what I hoped for. Given that you've had repeated boils in the armpits, the pattern fits hidradenitis suppurativa, a condition of the sweat glands and hair follicles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How interesting. I had never heard of that. Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's chronic but manageable, and it's helped a lot by stopping smoking and managing your diabetes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do see the connection you're making. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange an HbA1c blood test to see how your sugar control has been."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Certainly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep using the wash, wear loose cotton clothing, and avoid shaving the area for now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very well. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, once the antibiotics are done, to check the area and talk about longer-term options."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. Thank you, Nurse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Mind how you go. ~"
  }
 ],
